  "body": "Adds [appropriate markup](https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/blob/master/docs/dfn-contract.md) to all of the `<dfn>` elements in WebIDL, so the spec can be added to Shepherd and linked properly by all Bikeshedded specs.  Nearly all of the definitions are reasonable to export and link to.\n\nAlso adds appropriate markup to the `<h4>`s for several IDL types that don't otherwise have a `<dfn>` element (because everything in the spec just links to the section instead).\n",
